      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_2b9b6583",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image shows a middle-aged man with glasses and a smug expression, arms crossed, against a plain pink background. The text overlay reads 'when you bout high as fuck!'. The overall intent is to humorously depict a state of extreme intoxication or euphoria, using the man's self-satisfied demeanor as a visual punchline. The meme is not targeting any specific group based on protected characteristics and does not contain abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or propaganda elements. The intent is purely comedic and relies on the juxtaposition of the text (a state of being 'high as fuck') with the image of a person who appears overly confident or pleased with themselves, implying that this is the typical reaction to being extremely intoxicated. The language is vulgar but is used for comedic effect within the context of internet meme culture, not to target or harm any group.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_2ef00cbd"
      },
