      "label": "Stereotype of smug confidence as a reaction to intoxication",
      "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that people who are extremely intoxicated or euphoric often display exaggerated self-confidence or smugness. This is a common trope in humor and comedy, where the visual of a self-satisfied person is juxtaposed with a state of being 'high as fuck' to create a punchline. This stereotype is not unique to any specific group but is a general cultural observation.",
