      "instance_name": "internet_meme_culture",
      "label": "Internet meme culture and its conventions",
      "description": "The meme format — combining a stock image with a humorous or ironic text overlay — is a hallmark of internet meme culture. Understanding that this is a meme requires knowledge of how memes function: they often rely on visual juxtaposition, relatable situations, and internet slang for comedic effect. The phrase 'bout high as fuck!' is an example of internet slang, which is part of this cultural context.",
