      "description": "The textual phrase 'when you bout high as fuck!' is juxtaposed with the visual of a man displaying smug confidence. The meme humorously maps the state of extreme intoxication or euphoria (high_as_fuck_intoxication) onto the visual expression of smug confidence (smug_confidence). This creates an analogical mapping where the man's self-satisfied demeanor is interpreted as the typical reaction to being 'high as fuck'. The mapping is formalized by linking the textual material (text_chunk) to the visual material (smug_confidence) through the conceptual entity 'high_as_fuck_intoxication'.",
